"ping" this command is use for checking any website is online or not , it send some small packets to the given website and if all the packets are comming back its mean the web is online.
now give a example of this "ping google.com" by this we can know that google server is ready for give us respond or not means it active or not.
working procrdure :
1. By DNS the computer translate the name to the IP address of this web.
2. It sends some small ICMP packets to the given web .
3. It waits for the respond of the google server and by measuring this it gives us the time taken(milisecond)
4. It also checks that any packet is missing or not at the time of respond , if missing it meand the connection is poor.
